/F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 742 Tm (AcmeCorp Travel and Expense Policy) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 714 Tm (Owner: Finance) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (Version 6, effective 1 February 2026) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 686 Tm (Applies to: all employees) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 658 Tm (1. Principle) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 640 Tm (Spend company money as carefully as you would spend your own. Expenses are reimbursed) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 626 Tm (when they are necessary for the business, reasonable in amount and supported by a) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 612 Tm (receipt.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 584 Tm (2. Booking travel) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 566 Tm (All flights, trains and hotels are booked through the company travel portal. Bookings) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 552 Tm (made elsewhere are reimbursed only when the portal was unavailable or could not offer) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 538 Tm (the route.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 518 Tm (- Flights under 6 hours are booked in economy class.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 504 Tm (- Flights of 6 hours or more may be booked in premium economy.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 490 Tm (- Business class needs written approval from a department head.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 476 Tm (- Rail travel is second class for journeys under 3 hours.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 456 Tm (Book at least 14 days ahead where the travel dates are known.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 428 Tm (3. Hotels) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 410 Tm (The hotel limit is 160 EUR per night, including breakfast and taxes. In the cities) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 396 Tm (listed as high-cost in the travel portal the limit is 220 EUR per night.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 368 Tm (4. Meals) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 350 Tm (When travelling, meals are reimbursed up to 60 EUR per day. Alcohol is not reimbursed) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 336 Tm (unless it is part of an approved customer event.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 308 Tm (5. Customer entertainment) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 290 Tm (Entertaining customers needs approval from your manager in advance. The limit is 80 EUR) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 276 Tm (per person. The names and companies of everyone present must be recorded on the claim.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 248 Tm (6. Using your own car) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 230 Tm (Business journeys in a private car are reimbursed at 0.42 EUR per kilometre. Commuting) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 216 Tm (between home and your normal place of work is not a business journey.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 188 Tm (7. Submitting a claim) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 170 Tm (Claims are submitted in the expense tool within 30 days of the expense. Every item over) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 156 Tm (25 EUR needs a receipt. Claims are approved by the line manager and paid with the next) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 142 Tm (monthly payroll run.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 122 Tm (Claims submitted more than 90 days after the expense are not paid without approval from) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 108 Tm (the Finance Director.) Tj
ET
